10896 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 10897 0 R/Alt(Block diagram: count_q from the Q output of the register feeds a comparator with CTR_MAX, an incrementer, and input 0 of an enable multiplexer. The comparator output wrap selects between count_q plus 1 and zero in a wrap multiplexer, whose output goes to input 1 of the enable multiplexer. enable_i selects the enable multiplexer, whose output count_d enters the D input of the register. The register has the inputs clock_i and reset_i, and count_q is also the output counter_value_o.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[47]/Pg 28246 0 R>>
endobj
